<title>USA: Greenfield acquires tool manufacturer.</title>
<headline>Greenfield acquires tool manufacturer.</headline>
<dateline>AUGUSTA, Ga. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greenfield Industries Inc said Monday it has acquired a unit of Federal Signal Corp for about $14 million.</p>
<p>The deal, which closed on Friday, was for Bassett Rotary Tool Co, Greenfield said. Bassett, based in Monticello, Ind., manufactures solid carbide rotary cutting tools.</p>
<p>Greenfield manufactures expendable cutting tools and related products.</p>
</text>
